### MCDT System & Health Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:25580
@token = test-token

### 1. Health check with Bearer authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 2. Health check unauthorized (expected 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/health
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 3. OpenAPI 3.1 specification (public, no auth needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 4. Interactive Scalar API documentation (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 5. ReDoc API documentation (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/redoc
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
